	(text "Total current: ~18.5 A\nPower: 92W --> 100W power supply\n^ worst case, max brightness, RBG fully on\nunicolor --> 6A\n50% brightness cap --> I/2\n\nAs long as we never go full white, 10A power supply is okay"
