	(text "Pulled down so it doesn't float\nand accidentally turn on.\n\nGPIO triggered gate\n\n(5V-2.1V-2.1V)/(4*15ma)\n= 16.6666667 Ohms\n\nExpected 15mA per branch\nWill use PWM for brightness"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 135.636 0)
		(effects
